      en: ["Established in 1884 by Pope Leo XIII.", "Responsible for floral arrangements during 'Urbi et Orbi' blessings.", "Manages the official collection of papal thrones and canopies.", "Stores an inventory of over 1,000 unique carpets and textiles.", "Prepares the logistics for St. Peter's Square during canonizations.", "Operates under the Administration of the Governorate of Vatican City."],
